              "value": "Rejuvenation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult)\n\nWhen a poltergeist is destroyed, it re-forms, fully healed, where it was destroyed after 2d4 days. These Saggorak poltergeists no longer rejuvenate once King Harral no longer exists as an undead ruler of Saggorak."
